          <choice_text>$5 ( e^{- t} - e^{- 2 t} )$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계수가 공식 정답과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$10 ( e^{- t} - e^{- 2 t} )$</choice_text>
          <commentary>10(e^(−t) − e^(−2t))이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$5 ( e^{- t} + e^{- 2 t} )$</choice_text>
          <commentary>v₂(0) = 0 조건을 만족하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$10 ( e^{- t} + e^{- 2 t} )$</choice_text>
          <commentary>v₂(0) = 0 조건을 만족하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2016년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="8" id="PRB-7C0AE55E6096C32C-Q8">
      <question_stem>다음 회로에서 전류 $i_{s} ( t ) = 6 u ( t )$[mA]일 때, $v_{o} ( t )$[mV]는? (단, $u ( t )$는 단위 계단 함수이다)</question_stem>
