        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$4 + 3 e^{- 3 t}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>최종값이 공식 정답과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$2 + 4 e^{- 2 t}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>시정수가 공식 정답과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$2 + 4 e^{- 3 t}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>2 + 4e^(−3t)이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
